#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 36
#: rc.cpp:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "Minimum height:"
msgstr "最小高度:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 46
#: rc.cpp:8
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The height of the image shown will not get smaller than the size you enter "
"here.\n"
"A value of 10 would cause a 1x1 image to be stretched vertically by a factor "
"of 10."
msgstr ""
"顯示的圖像的高度不會小於你在此設定的大小。\n"
"輸入「10」會令 1x1 的圖像垂直放大十倍。"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 54
#: rc.cpp:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximum height:"
msgstr "最大高度:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 64
#: rc.cpp:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The height of the image shown will not get bigger than the size you enter "
"here.\n"
"A value of 100 would cause a 1000x1000 image to be compressed vertically by "
"a factor of 0.1."
msgstr ""
"顯示的圖像的高度不會大於你在此設定的大小。\n"
"輸入「100」會令 1000x1000 的圖像垂直壓縮 10 倍。"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 72
#: rc.cpp:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "Minimum width:"
msgstr "最小闊度:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 82
#: rc.cpp:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The width of the image shown will not get smaller than the size you enter "
"here.\n"
"A value of 10 would cause a 1x1 image to be stretched horizontally by a "
"factor of 10."
msgstr ""
"顯示的圖像的闊度不會小於你在此設定的大小。\n"
"輸入「10」會令 1x1 的圖像水平放大十倍。"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 90
#: rc.cpp:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximum width:"
msgstr "最大闊度:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 100
#: rc.cpp:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The width of the image shown will not get bigger than the size you enter "
"here.\n"
"A value of 100 would cause a 1000x1000 image to be compressed horizontally "
"by a factor of 0.1."
msgstr ""
"顯示的圖像的闊度不會大於你在此設定的大小。\n"
"輸入「100」會令 1000x1000 的圖像水平壓縮 10 倍。"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 152
#: rc.cpp:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose which blend effects should be used:"
msgstr "選擇要用的混合效果:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 158
#: rc.cpp:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "效果"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 177
#: rc.cpp:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every effect selected may be used to create a transition effect between the "
"images. If you select multiple effects they will be chosen randomly."
msgstr ""
"每個選擇的效果用於在圖像間建立轉變效果。如選擇多個效果，它們會隨機地應用。"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 195
#: rc.cpp:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use smooth scaling (high quality but slower)"
msgstr "使用平滑縮放（質素較高但較慢）"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 203
#: rc.cpp:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Keep aspect ratio"
msgstr "保持長闊比例"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 206
#: rc.cpp:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is checked KView will always try to keep the aspect ratio. That "
"means if the width is scaled with a factor x, the height is scaled with the "
"same factor."
msgstr ""
"如選擇此處， KView 會嘗試保持長闊比例。意即如果闊度以 x 的比例縮放，高度亦會"
"以同一比例縮放。"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalconfigwidget.ui line 214
#: rc.cpp:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "Center image"
msgstr "將圖像置中"

#: defaults.h:35
msgid "No Blending"
msgstr "不混合"

#: defaults.h:36
msgid "Wipe From Left"
msgstr "從左邊開始消除"

#: defaults.h:37
msgid "Wipe From Right"
msgstr "從右邊開始消除"

#: defaults.h:38
msgid "Wipe From Top"
msgstr "從上邊開始消除"

#: defaults.h:39
msgid "Wipe From Bottom"
msgstr "從下邊開始消除"

#: defaults.h:40
msgid "Alpha Blend"
msgstr "透明混合"
